{"products":[{"id":8926632017999,"title":"Jade Gua Sha + Face Roller Set","handle":"iyu-gua-sha-face-roller-set","body_html":"\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eSkincare works better when it's worked in. This set pairs two of the oldest tools in Korean and Chinese beauty with the one thing your routine is probably missing: pressure, direction, and\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003ea little time.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eThe\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003egua sha stone\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eis carved from natural jade with a contoured edge that follows the jawline, cheekbone, and brow — for the slow, sweeping strokes traditionally used to release facial tension and encourage lymphatic movement. The\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003edual-ended roller\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003edoes the softer work: the large head glides across cheeks, forehead, and neck, while the small head handles the delicate skin under\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-wf=\"\" class=\"_wordAnimating_yu34g_11\"\u003ethe\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-wf=\"\" class=\"_wordAnimating_yu34g_11\"\u003eeyes.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eJade stays naturally cool against the skin, and cool feels good on a face that's been squinting at a screen since 8am. Used with a facial oil or your JIYU serum, both\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003etools help move product across the skin instead of letting it sit on top of it — so your actives land where\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-wf=\"\" class=\"_wordAnimating_yu34g_11\"\u003eyou\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-wf=\"\" class=\"_wordAnimating_yu34g_11\"\u003ewant\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-wf=\"\" class=\"_wordAnimating_yu34g_11\"\u003ethem.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=